        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phantom City Mist is a PRG role-playing game where players take on the role of a young man who has just entered the martial arts world. They explore the open world, find an NPC at a designated location, and solve the main storyline step by step. The goal is to unlock all maps and storylines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game plot is a distinctive feature of this work. The development team has conceived a story of a hero and turned the scenes in the story into a game map, allowing players to have a more immersive experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main storyline: Players explore different maps, find designated NPCs for dialogue, and connect the protagonist's story to experience the thrilling plot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open World: Explore every corner of the map, find hidden treasure chests, and even encounter terrifying monsters. Defeat them to escape! (The combat mode adopts turn based mode)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game duration: Approximately 5 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features: Narrative PRG Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Engine: prgmaker mv</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game map: City of Illusion, Fishing Village, Ghost Valley, Demon Realm Blood Pool, Demon Realm, Coast</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow up plan: Introduce more maps and multi ending storylines, and of course, developers will also carefully listen to players' opinions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
